  "name": "Jai-Code-Collection",
  "description": "A comprehensive repository of standalone HTML5 applications, featuring a diverse array of casual games, multimedia players, and WASM-powered emulators. The project centers on the HGP (HTML Game Player) and HCS (HTML Computer System) frameworks, showcasing the delivery of complex web runtimes and utility tools via portable, single-file architectures. It serves as both a distribution hub for browser-native software and a playground for exploring client-side persistence and interactive web simulations.",
